sity’s flagship career fair reaffirms its relevance in connecting talent with the job market.\n\nAbout #Bocconi&#Jobs\nBocconi&Jobs is the University's main career fair. It is held twice a year and hosts employers from various countries and sectors, including Auditing, Consulting, Finance, Industrial & Consumer Goods, Services, Law and Tax Firms, Tech.\n\nA unique opportunity to interact with recruiters on-campus, discover internship and job opportunities, and submit your application.\nDiscover more:\n➤ https://www.unibocconi.it/en/current-students/career-services/meet-employers/bocconijobs\n➤ https://www.unibocconi.it/en/employers-and-partners/career-fairs Recruiting Date Arts, Sport & Entertainment Recruiting Date Web & IT Companies Investment Banking Days Bocconi&Jobs abroad Paris Tax & Legal Networking Event Contacts For each initiative you will find a specific contact to ask for more info, if needed. Check the areas above to find the activity of your interest and related contacts. For general information you can contact the Career Service Infopoint: check the FAQ at yoU@B> B in Touch> Career Services and submit your question. Alternatively, you can always reach us through individual appointments at the path: yoU@B> Career Service> Ask for information - book your slot, or through the dedicated number: +39 02 5836.2711. Follow us on LinkedIn Scroll to top Stay in touch Contacts Stay in touch Facebook Linkedin Youtube Instagram Tiktok Weechat Xiaohongshu/RED Listen to our podcast Spotify Spreaker Apple podcast Bocconi Spheres SDA Bocconi School of Management Egea Alumni B4i - Bocconi for innovation yoU@B Agenda Work at Bocconi Media center BTV TL ON Mobile app yoU@B Campus VR Mobile app yoU@B Bocconi shop © Università Bocconi - Via Sarfatti, 25 Milano - PI 03628350153 Footer Privacy Digital accessibility Copy link ✓ Thanks for sharing! Find any service AddToAny More… × Notice We   and selected third parties   collect personal information as specified in the privacy policy and use cookies or similar technologies  for technical purposes and, with your consent, for functionality, experience, measurement and “marketing (personalized ads)” as specified in the cookie policy . You can freely give, deny, or withdraw your consent at any time by accessing the preferences panel.  Denying consent may make related features unavailable. Use the “Accept” button to consent. Use the “Reject” button or close this notice to continue without accepting. Press again to continue 0/1 Learn more and customize Reject Accept"
